  "id": "BIT-mongodb-2026-18709",
  "summary": "Missing Authorization in MongoDB Sharded Transaction Commit/Abort Handling Leads to Cross-Shard Data Inconsistency",
  "details": "An issue in MongoDB Server could allow an authenticated user with direct network access to a shard to improperly commit or abort an in-progress prepared transaction, bypassing the intended transaction coordination process. This could result in cross-shard data inconsistency, cluster clock corruption, and violation of transaction atomicity guarantees.",
